{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":true},"description":"Compare a selected car shortlist; use search_vehicles to discover candidates or get_vehicle for one car.\n\n- vehicle_ids chooses the adverts to include, in buyer-selected order; it does not rerun search filters. Resolve ID/slug aliases to distinct listing_id values. Repeating an advert must not create extra price evidence or imply another vehicle.\n- Keep unknown-price candidates visible when the buyer still wants to consider them. A cheapest result ranks only distinct, known positive prices; inspect price_comparison_complete before describing it as cheapest across the whole shortlist. Asking prices are not valuations.\n- Anonymous fresh lookups can partially fail. Inspect not_found/unavailable and retry temporary failures before excluding a candidate. Use prepare_vehicle_handoff after choosing; comparison reserves nothing.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"vehicle_ids":{"description":"Two to four listing_id values from search_vehicles or public listing slugs, not VINs or URLs. Choose distinct listings; repeated IDs or an ID and its slug do not provide separate price evidence.","items":{"maxLength":120,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"maxItems":4,"minItems":2,"type":"array"}},"required":["vehicle_ids"],"type":"object"},"name":"compare_vehicles","outputSchema":{"$defs":{"error":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"error":{"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["error"],"type":"object"},"inspection":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"battery_health_percent":{"type":["number","null"]},"final_grade":{"type":["string","null"]},"identity_match":{"type":["string","boolean","null"]},"overall_score":{"type":["number","null"]},"qc_approved_at":{"type":["string","null"]},"repair_estimate_bdt":{"type":["number","null"]}},"required":["final_grade","overall_score","repair_estimate_bdt","battery_health_percent","id